\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2 : Baht Powers To 3-Mo High As Stocks Soar \b0\par\par\uc2  By Tom Holland \par \uc2 185 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Mai 1999\par 10:56\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--The Thai baht powered to a three-month high Tuesday, propelled upward by investment inflows into the domestic stock market. \par \par \uc2  Most other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  slipped back. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah lost ground as Indonesian investors took advantage of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's recent rally to acquire U.S. dollars, while the threat of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  depressed the \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar, the won and the New Taiwan dollar. \par \par \uc2  But the falls failed to deter offshore investors, who remained strongly bullish toward local \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "The dollar would be down against all the Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  if it weren't for the central banks," said the regional head of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at a Japanese bank in \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  In many Asian countries, the fear of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to check excessive local-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  appreciation and protect export competitiveness is the only factor balancing heavy inflows of foreign capital, he explained. \par \par \uc2  "Net-net it's still a 'sell the dollar against Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ' story," he said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 04-05-99 \par \par \uc2  0856GMT \par \par \uc2  1136 4250 \par \par 