\par\par \b \uc2  ASIA  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2  - Regionals rise, rupiah risk grows. \b0\par\par\uc2 668 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 02:51\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      0130 GMT - The dollar slipped against the yen in early \par \par \uc2  Asian trade, as focus turned to Japan's GDP figures and the \par \par \uc2  BOJ's policy board meeting on Friday. \par \par \uc2      Dealers said the first level of support for the dollar was \par \par \uc2  pegged at 119.23 yen - the 21 day moving average. Traders \par \par \uc2  don't expect a break of 119 before the board meeting, but they \par \par \uc2  say that short-covering could push the dollar higher if the \par \par \uc2  policy board endorses a weaker yen. \par \par \uc2      There is some speculation that growth figures could \par \par \uc2  surprise on the upside. \par \par \uc2      *** In the debt market, JGBs are seen well-bid. Yen bond \par \par \uc2  futures in London added to yesterday's gains on the view that \par \par \uc2  JGB issuance will not expand after April. \par \par \uc2      Trading here is also expected to be light ahead of the \par \par \uc2  policy board meeting. \par \par \uc2      In the short term market, the overnight call rate is \par \par \uc2  creeping higher again, as foreign funds continue to borrow \par \par \uc2  heavily in the market. In early business the unsecured \par \par \uc2  overnight call rate rose to 0.05 percent from 0.02 percent. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ is expected to keep the market liquid - they plan \par \par \uc2  to leave a surplus in the market of 1.2 trillion yen in \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  this morning. \par \par \uc2      *** Wall Street's rally overnight could help the Nikkei in \par \par \uc2  a push for the 16,000 level, which may also support the yen. \par \par \uc2      *** Regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  were mostly firmer, tracking the \par \par \uc2  yen in early business but problems in the rupiah market were \par \par \uc2  beginning to undermine sentiment in southeast Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2      *** The Indonesian rupiah was heading for its next target \par \par \uc2  of 9,200 to the dollar after breaching the 9,000 level on \par \par \uc2  Wednesday despite recent support from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , through \par \par \uc2  state banks. \par \par \uc2  The government is expected to announce the names of banks \par \par \uc2  to be closed and those to be recapitalised either late on \par \par \uc2  Friday or Saturday. But there are worries that the reform \par \par \uc2  measure would fall short of expectations due to political \par \par \uc2  lobbying by well-connected businessmen. \par \par \uc2  *** The \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore (MAS) will announce \par \par \uc2  detailed plans and steps to liberalise the financial sector in \par \par \uc2  April. \par \par \uc2  Deputy Prime Minister Lee Hsien Loong said the MAS would \par \par \uc2  also step into the market to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar \par \par \uc2  as and when it was needed. \par \par \uc2  "If it (Singapore dollar) deviates too far from what we \par \par \uc2  judge to be the fundamentals, then MAS does not hesitate to \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in order to bring it back up," Lee said. \par \par \uc2  Lee said although the Singapore dollar had depreciated by \par \par \uc2  about 20 percent against the U.S. dollar since the Asian \par \par \uc2  economic crisis started in 1997, on a trade-weighted basis it \par \par \uc2  had been more or less stable. \par \par \uc2  *** Chinese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief Dai Xianglong said China was \par \par \uc2  not studying a devaluation of the yuan and the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \par \par \uc2  remain stable this year. \par \par \uc2  China's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves have risen above $146 \par \par \uc2  billion, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said in a statement. At the end of \par \par \uc2  1998, the reserves were around $145 billion, according to \par \par \uc2  earlier government figures. \par \par \uc2       Change on the dayGMT \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ...Latest bid....Prev Close....Pct Move \par \par \uc2   Ringgit......3.7998.......3.8000.........0.01% \par \par \uc2   Rupiah......9050.00......8967.00........-0.92% \par \par \uc2   Baht..........37.50........37.45........-0.13% \par \par \uc2   Peso..........38.92........39.00.........0.21% \par \par \uc2   Sing dlr.....1.7312.......1.7303........-0.05% \par \par \uc2   Taiwan dlr...33.000.......33.080.........0.24% \par \par \uc2   Korean won..1229.60......1231.00.........0.11% \par \par \uc2   Japan yen....119.64.......120.41.........0.64% \par \par \uc2   Change since start of Asia crisis \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .....Latest......July '97......Pct Move \par \par \uc2   Ringgit......3.7998.......2.5200........-33.68% \par \par \uc2   Rupiah......9050.00......2432.00........-73.13% \par \par \uc2   Baht..........37.50........25.90........-30.93% \par \par \uc2   Peso..........38.92........26.50........-31.91% \par \par \uc2   Sing dlr.....1.7312.......1.4300........-17.40% \par \par \uc2   Taiwan dlr..33.0000......27.7500........-15.91% \par \par \uc2   Korean won..1229.60.......842.00........-31.52% \par \par \uc2   Japan yen....119.64.......114.40.........-4.38% \par \par \uc2  ************************************************ \par \par \uc2   - Asia \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  Desk (65) 870-3840 \par \par \uc2   - Email: asia.\b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2 @reuters.com. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv3b05pwn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
