\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  -3: Peso Volatility Doesn't Materialize \b0\par\par\uc2 254 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Februar 1999\par 10:29\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar was also trading on the Philippine Dealing System at 38.53 pesos (PHP), well down from PHP38.98 late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  There had been expectations in the market that the dollar would be quite volatile against the peso Thursday because a number of non-deliverable contracts came due, traders said. Instead, the U.S. dollar simply slipped, they said. \par \par \uc2  "We had been expecting a huge inflow of U.S. dollars, but it didn't really come about - just odd-lot U.S. dollar selling as the yen climbed, which pushed the peso higher," said a trader at a U.S. bank in \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  There was no overt sign of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Philippine \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which had been buying U.S. dollars in recent sessions to meet upcoming debt payments, traders said. \par \par \uc2  "The peso looked overextended on dollar-buying earlier this week by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Tan said, who now expects the dollar to stabilize around PHP39.50 to PHP40 during the next two or three months. \par \par \uc2  After that, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategists and economists forecast that continuing falling interest rates will place downward pressure on the peso. \par \par \uc2  "There is a growing feeling that falling interest rates are no longer pricing in the risk premium, but there is still a recognition that the Philippines must continue to drive down the rates. That means a weaker peso," said a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at a European bank in Singapore. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires  02-11-99 \par \par \uc2  0429EST \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010826dv2b00a07\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
