\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2 : Singapore Dlr Sold Down Early \b0\par\par\uc2 308 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Dezember 1998\par 03:20\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--The Singapore dollar has slipped abruptly in early trading on Wednesday in Southeast Asia's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. Other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  have held their own against the U.S. dollar, however, as the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has softened against the yen. \par \par \uc2  Aggressive U.S. dollar buying by local banks in Singapore lifted the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the Singapore dollar from the start of the trading day, according to dealers in the island republic. \par \par \uc2  "The U.K. clearing banks were selling the U.S. dollar down in London hours, and it looks like the authority is pretty keen to bring it back up," said a trader at a U.S. bank in Singapore, referring to the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore. \par \par \uc2  The de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which manages monetary policy in Singapore with its ample reserves to steer the \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar's exchange rate, is widely believed to be \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to moderate any tendency the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  may have to appreciate. \par \par \uc2  The trader added, however, that interest to sell the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  emerging at current levels looks set to cap the U.S. dollar, at least in the short term. \par \par \uc2  At 0155 GMT (8:55 p.m. EST) the U.S. dollar is quoted at S$1.6512, up from S$1.6471 late in Asia on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Activity in other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets is quiet, with the U.S. dollar drifting sideways against both the baht (THB) and the rupiah (IDR). \par \par \uc2  Against the the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the U.S. dollar is quoted at THB36.0550, a fraction lower than THB36.0650 late the day before. Against the rupiah, the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is at IDR7,462, compared with IDR7,465. \par \par \uc2  -By Tom Holland; 65 421 4800 \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 02-12-98 \par \par \uc2  0220GMT \par \par \uc2  1136 4250 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917duc201qwg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
