rmine Singapore's economic competitiveness, he said. \par \par \uc2  Late Friday the U.S. dollar ended Asian interbank trading hours at S$1.6290, down slightly from S$1.6315 Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Still isolated from the other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  by perceptions of exceptional domestic political risk, the Indonesian rupiah (IDR) ended Friday flat, with the U.S. dollar unchanged from the previous day at IDR7,525. \par \par \uc2  -By Tom Holland; 65 421 4800 \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires  11-20-98 \par \par \uc2  0619EST \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916dubk02pd3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
