\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2 /Early -2: MAS  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Suspected \b0\par\par\uc2 257 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 August 1998\par 04:37\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    The U.S. dollar's rebound against the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar\par has been assisted by market talk that the authorities in the\par island republic have been buying U.S. dollars.\par    "Yesterday the local banks were buying aggressively\par around the S$1.75 level," said a trader at a U.S. bank in\par Singapore, suggesting that the bids were placed on behalf of\par the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of Singapore.\par    The island republic's de facto \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is widely\par believed to be concerned about the impact on trade\par competitiveness of the Singapore dollar's outperformance\par relative to other Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par    Barring any violent moves in the yen, the U.S. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par is likely to push higher toward S$1.7550 over the course of\par Friday's session, he added.\par    Activity levels in other Southeast Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets\par are relatively low, said traders, with most of the regional\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  being quoted in line with the yen.\par    Against the ringgit, the U.S.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  dollar is at 4.1880 ringgit\par (MYR), up from MYR4.1700 late in Asia on Thursday.\par    The U.S. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is also at 41.13 baht (THB), up from an\par overnight low of THB40.9750, but still below THB41.1450 late\par in Asia the day before.\par    Against the rupiah, meanwhile, the U.S. dollar is at\par 11,450 rupiah (IDR), up a touch from IDR11,425 overnight, but\par down from IDR11,650 late in Asian trade Thursday.\par    -By Tom Holland; 65 421 4800\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  08-20-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2237EDT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916du8l01yjr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
