\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Singapore \highlight\uc2  welcomes joint dlr/yen  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 159 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Juni 1998\par 13:04\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 SINGAPORE\b0 \highlight\uc2 , June 18 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Thursday it welcomed the dollar/yen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the United States and Japan. \par \par \uc2  In a response to Reuters' queries on the joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MAS) said: \par \par \uc2  "MAS welcomes the return of more stable and orderly conditions in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market following the joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by US and Japan." \par \par \uc2  "The action has reversed the general overpessimism in Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," the de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said in a statement. \par \par \uc2  Concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the United States and Japan in New York trading on Wednesday saw the yen rally more than five yen against the U.S. dollar. The rally triggered surges in other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  as well. \par \par \uc2  The singapore dollar rose to 1.64 against the dollar compared to 1.72 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  - Singapore Newsroom (65) 870-3080; Fax (65) 776-8112 \par \par \uc2  - Email: singapore.newsroom@reuters.com. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du6i02ry0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
