\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Dlr Down Early On Regional  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2 , Stock Falls \b0\par\par\uc2 243 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Mai 1998\par 04:21\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)-- The Singapore dollar is lower against the U.S. dollar in early trading Wednesday as the market has sold the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  down in reaction to falls in the local stock market, the ringgit and the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  'Although the view on the dollar against the yen is down, there is interest to bid up the dollar against the ringgit and the Singapore dollar,' said a trader at a U.K. bank in Singapore. \par \par \uc2  Traders also cited fears that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the island republic's de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent excessive local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strength as a reason to sell the Singapore dollar. \par \par \uc2  In addition, some dealers saw sales of the Singapore \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the baht as a play on the yield differential between the two \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  At 0215 GMT (10:15 p.m. EDT Tuesday) the U.S. dollar is trading at S$1.5878, up from S$1.5850 late the previous day. \par \par \uc2  In the cross market, the ringgit is at S$0.4275, down from S$0.4319 late on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  In Singapore's domestic money market, the overnight rate on local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  deposits is at 4.00%-4.25%, up from 3.25%-3.50% late Tuesday. The three-month rate is unchanged at 4.875%-5.00%. \par \par \uc2  -By Tom Holland; 65 421 4800 \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 06-05-98 \par \par \uc2  0221GMT \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du5603s0y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
