\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Late-AM: Dollar Breaks Up Though Y132, Stops Eyed \b0\par\par\uc2 278 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 April 1998\par 05:58\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--The U.S. dollar broke through the Y132.00 level against the Japanese yen in late-morning trading in Singapore on Friday. \par \par \uc2  After the dollar earlier traded tested Y132.00, market nervousness of Bank of Japan \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  led to a modest sell-off ahead of remarks by BOJ Governor Masuru Hayami. \par \par \uc2  But the more time that passes without BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  - the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was last seen selling dollars a week ago - the more bullish on the dollar the market becomes, say traders. \par \par \uc2  With the 254-point fall Friday morning in Japan's benchmark Nikkei stock index adding impetus to the yen's fall. Market participants may be willing to push the dollar higher still, say traders. \par \par \uc2  'If the dollar reaches Y132.10 we will see intraday stops triggered, but much higher and the market will be entering the danger zone,' warned the head of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at a U.K. bank in \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Although the chances of joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the central banks of the Group of Seven countries appeared to recede following the G-7 meeting in Washington Wednesday, the market would be foolish to rule out the possibility altogether, he said. \par \par \uc2  Around 0350 GMT (11:50 p.m. Thursday EDT) the dollar is quoted at Y132.07, up from Y131.80 around 0230 GMT (10:30 p.m. Thursday EDT) and in New York late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Against the yen, the Deutsche mark is at Y73.08, up from Y72.91 earlier in Tokyo but a touch below Y73.04 in New York late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 17-04-98 \par \par \uc2  0358GMT \par \par \uc2  1074 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du4h037xe\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
