\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2 /Early -2: S$ Sinks But Rupiah Rises \b0\par\par\uc2 308 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1998\par 02:58\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    The Singapore dollar is also lower in early trading on\par what traders say is U.S. dollar buying by local\par corporations.\par    While some traders dismiss rumors that the Singapore\par dollar's failure to break convincingly through the S$1.60 to\par the U.S. dollar barrier is due to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , they acknowledge that local\par interest to acquire U.S. dollars at that level means further\par local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strengthening is unlikely in the near term.\par    At 0140 GMT the U.S. dollar is quoted at S$1.6080, up\par from S$1.5995 late Monday as corporate U.S. dollar buying\par spurs market players to cover their short positions in the\par U.S. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par    In contrast, the rupiah is higher early Tuesday\par following Bank Indonesia's interest rate increase Monday,\par which saw one-month rates lifted to 45% from 22% previously.\par    The U.S. dollar is quoted at an intraday low of 8,750\par rupiah (IDR), down from IDR9,100 late the day before.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    Liquidity in the Indonesian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  remains extremely\par thin, despite growing market optimism that the government\par may strike a fresh deal with the International Monetary Fund\par allowing the release of the next round of IMF funding.\par    "There is just too much uncertainty in rupiah trading.\par I'm not touching it," said the regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ' trader\par at the Singapore branch of one European bank.\par    The baht is also higher early Tuesday, as market\par confidence in Thailand's recovery remains high and the\par chances of a cut in interest rates in the near term recede.\par    The U.S. dollar is currently quoted at 38.45 baht (THB),\par down from THB38.70 late in Asia on Monday.\par    -By Tom Holland; 65 421 4800\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  03-23-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2058EST\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1136 4250 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916du3o00ojy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
